ing to see a film. 她打算做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"买词典"},{"key":"B","text":"去超市"},{"key":"C","text":"看望祖父母"},{"key":"D","text":"看电影"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"see a film。","verify":"\"看电影\""},{"id":"cne_p164_q4","topicId":"cne_p164","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"We are going to the supermarket. 我们打算去哪里？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"超市"},{"key":"B","text":"电影院"},{"key":"C","text":"书店"},{"key":"D","text":"医院"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"the supermarket。","verify":"\"超市\""},{"id":"cne_p165_q1","topicId":"cne_p165","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想说自己明天打算去旅行，应说哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I am going to see a film tomorrow."},{"key":"B","text":"I am going to the supermarket tomorrow."},{"key":"C","text":"I am going to take a trip tomorrow."},{"key":"D","text":"I am going to buy a dictionary tomorrow."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"旅行是 take a trip。","verify":"\"I am going to take a trip tomorrow.\""},{"id":"cne_p165_q2","topicId":"cne_p165","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"What are you going to do this weekend? 这句是在问什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"这个周末你正在做什么"},{"key":"B","text":"上个周末你做了什么"},{"key":"C","text":"你每天做什么"},{"key":"D","text":"这个周末你打算做什么"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"this weekend 加上 going to 是打算。","verify":"\"这个周末你打算做什么\""},{"id":"cne_p165_q3","topicId":"cne_p165","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"He is going to buy a dictionary. 他打算买什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"词典"},{"key":"B","text":"电影票"},{"key":"C","text":"旅行票"},{"key":"D","text":"超市里的面包"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"a dictionary。","verify":"\"词典\""},{"id":"cne_p165_q4","topicId":"cne_p165","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Have a good time! 这句是在说什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"你必须停下"},{"key":"B","text":"祝你玩得开心"},{"key":"C","text":"请靠右走"},{"key":"D","text":"这太贵了"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"Have a good time 是祝对方玩得开心。","verify":"\"祝你玩得开心\""},{"id":"cne_p166_q1","topicId":"cne_p166","difficult